<view class="page {{themeClass}}"><view class="title">AI 快速修图</view><view class="hint"><view class="detail-title">修图功能正在完善</view><view>可以先参考姿势卡拍照，或在这里选择照片预览。当前不会上传照片、调用 AI 或扣除额度。</view></view><view class="sub" wx:if="{{sourceCardId}}">来自姿势卡 {{sourceCardId}}</view><view class="grid"><view class="card" wx:for="{{files}}" wx:key="*this"><image wx:if="{{item}}" class="photo" src="{{item}}" mode="aspectFit" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="preview"/></view></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!files.length}}">可选择 1—4 张照片，仅在本机预览</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><button class="button" bindtap="choose" disabled="{{busy}}">{{files.length?'重新选择照片':'选择照片'}}</button><button class="button primary" disabled>修图暂未开放</button><button wx:if="{{files.length}}" class="button" bindtap="clear">清除已选照片</button><view class="sub" style="margin-top:24rpx">离开本页后不保留选图记录。功能接通后，处理前会显示可用额度与处理规则。</view></view>